# Monorepo DTS-E-Commerce

Repo raíz: `git@github.com:osedhelu/DTS-E-Commerce.git`

## Submodules

| Path | Repo |
|------|------|
| `backend/` | `git@github.com:osedhelu/DTS-backend.git` |
| `web-admin/` | `git@github.com:osedhelu/DTS-web-admin.git` |
| `flutter-customer/` | `git@github.com:osedhelu/DTS-flutter-customer.git` |
| `flutter-driver/` | `git@github.com:osedhelu/DTS-flutter-driver.git` |

Clonar: `git clone --recurse-submodules …` · Actualizar: `git submodule update --init --recursive`

## Estructura

- `backend/` — Django API (uv, no pip) — **submodule**
- `web-admin/` — Next.js + Tailwind (merchant/admin) — **submodule**
- `flutter-customer/` — App cliente — **submodule**
- `flutter-driver/` — App conductor — **submodule**
- Raíz: `Makefile`, `docker-compose.yml`, `scripts/`

## Comandos raíz

```bash
make setup            # Docker + deps
make backend-test     # pytest
make web-admin-dev    # Next.js :3000
make flutter-test     # flutter test x2
```

## Docker obligatorio para dev backend

PostGIS + Redis: `make docker-up`

